      <title>LibreOffice 26.8 首周下载破百万，拒绝AI反而创纪录</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260904/LibreOffice-26.8-%E9%A6%96%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E7%A0%B4%E7%99%BE%E4%B8%87%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9DAI%E5%8F%8D%E8%80%8C%E5%88%9B%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95/</link>
